{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hanturium </strong>is a mix between a whodunit mystery game and horror game, with different randomly selected culprit each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938930/extras/4bbebb0e47fdbbfb20df6e8225d01de5.avif?t=1755575928\" width=630 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo you'll get a taste of the world of Hanturium:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 <strong>30\u201360 minutes of suspense</strong>\u00a0, a glimpse of the full 2.5-hour mystery we have planned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 <strong>Face 3 of the 10 creatures</strong> lurking in the complete game, each with their own chilling signature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Examine eerie anomalies</strong> left behind after their attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Hunt for the mastermind</strong> behind the attempts on Ricardo\u2019s life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Piece together 3 clues per suspect</strong> to narrow down the killer (in the full game, there will be 4\u20135 clues for deeper deduction).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938930/extras/ac903af571d21d6127502ce5b32a1696.avif?t=1755575928\" width=630 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude7a It's 1985.\u00a0You are <strong>Ida</strong>, a nurse working for <strong>Mertahita Hospital</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One night, a very wealthy and powerful patient was admitted to the hospital with weird symptoms and peculiar conditions: <strong>Ricardo Hartowo</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\u2695\ufe0f A family doctor. <br>\ud83d\udd2e A family &quot;spiritual guide&quot;. <br>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f A backstabbing family member, trying to kill the patient. <br> <br>What could possibly go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Play Hanturium, and your tasks will be\u00a0:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Examine the <strong>anomalies</strong> left by mystical creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdd Find <strong>notes</strong> left by the doctor and the shaman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Check the <strong>life support machine</strong> and mark abnormal medical symptoms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Pay attention to <strong>dialogues</strong>, <strong>characters</strong>, and the <strong>environment</strong> to uncover the culprit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Try to get the <strong>best possible completion time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938930/extras/5c04ab09c9731f34b0de2d7c3456b49b.avif?t=1755575928\" width=630 height=96 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move\u00a0 : A, S, W, D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint\u00a0 : Shift (while moving)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look\u00a0: Move Mouse\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action\u00a0:\u00a0 E</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue\u00a0 :\u00a0 R / Left mouse click\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu / Pause (in-game)\u00a0 :\u00a0 F</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip Intro\u00a0 :\u00a0 F (hold)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938930?t=1755575928","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938930/733f5c25919d0ebe6ad4e984bd77671a6ea590d3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755575928","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938930/3f529309276f9188588660ab924a16c45496a241/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755575928","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938930/3f529309276f9188588660ab924a16c45496a241/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755575928","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hanturium </strong>is a mix between a whodunit mystery game and horror game, with different randomly selected culprit each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938930/extras/4bbebb0e47fdbbfb20df6e8225d01de5.avif?t=1755575928\" width=630 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo you'll get a taste of the world of Hanturium:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 <strong>30\u201360 minutes of suspense</strong>\u00a0, a glimpse of the full 2.5-hour mystery we have planned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 <strong>Face 3 of the 10 creatures</strong> lurking in the complete game, each with their own chilling signature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Examine eerie anomalies</strong> left behind after their attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Hunt for the mastermind</strong> behind the attempts on Ricardo\u2019s life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Piece together 3 clues per 