steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938930/extras/5c04ab09c9731f34b0de2d7c3456b49b.avif?t=1755575928\" width=630 height=96 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move\u00a0 : A, S, W, D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint\u00a0 : Shift (while moving)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look\u00a0: Move Mouse\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action\u00a0:\u00a0 E</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue\u00a0 :\u00a0 R / Left mouse click\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu / Pause (in-game)\u00a0 :\u00a0 F</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip Intro\u00a0 :\u00a0 F (hold)</p></li></ul>","developers":["Plexus Studio","Oray Studios","Superfiksi"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3921560","name":"Hanturium"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938930/083e24989dff02003ae889306706c3b95af640f9/header.jpg?t=1755575928","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257179606,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257179606/movie480.mp4?t=1755083375","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257179606/movie_max.mp4?t=1755083375"},"name":"Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257179606/c2af06f3e379f600e64e0acb055f4bbb357193b9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755083375","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257179606/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755083375","max":"http://vi